# Deliberately empty of patterns, and that is the whole point of the file.
#
# .gitignore beside this one excludes *.wasm and *.mjs, because those are
# multi-megabyte binaries staged at release time and the repository is not
# where they belong. But `dart pub publish` selects files the same way git
# does, so it honoured that .gitignore too and would have published this
# package with the loader and the runtime missing: an application depending on
# it would build cleanly and then 404 at the first session.
#
# pub reads .pubignore in preference to .gitignore when it is present, so this
# file separates the two questions. Git still refuses to track the binaries.
# pub now ships them.
